<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-CN">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<title>数学作业提交系统 - 明舟教育</title>
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<style>
*{margin:0;padding:0;box-sizing:border-box;font-family:"Microsoft YaHei",sans-serif;}
body{background:#e3f2fd;padding:30px;}
.back-btn{padding:12px 24px;background:#0288d1;color:white;border-radius:30px;cursor:pointer;border:none;font-size:16px;margin-bottom:20px;}
.container{max-width:900px;margin:0 auto;}
.card{background:white;padding:30px;border-radius:20px;box-shadow:0 4px 15px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);margin-bottom:25px;}
.card h2{color:#0d47a1;margin-bottom:20px;font-size:26px;}
.form-item{margin-bottom:18px;}
.form-item label{display:block;margin-bottom:8px;font-weight:bold;font-size:16px;}
.form-item input,.form-item textarea,.form-item select{width:100%;padding:12px;border:1px solid #ccc;border-radius:8px;font-size:16px;}
.submit-btn{width:100%;padding:14px;background:#0288d1;color:white;border:none;border-radius:8px;font-size:18px;cursor:pointer;}
.video-area{padding:20px;background:#f5f9ff;border-radius:10px;text-align:center;}
.task-item{padding:12px;background:#f1f8e9;border-radius:8px;margin:8px 0;}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<button class="back-btn" onclick="location.href='index.html'">← 返回主页</button>
<div class="container">
    <div class="card">
        <h2>作业上传提交</h2>
        <div class="form-item"><label>学生姓名</label><input type="text" placeholder="请输入姓名"></div>
        <div class="form-item"><label>班级</label><select><option>一年级</option><option>二年级</option><option>三年级</option></select></div>
        <div class="form-item"><label>作业内容</label><textarea rows="4" placeholder="请填写作业答案"></textarea></div>
        <div class="form-item"><label>上传作业图片</label><input type="file" accept="image/*"></div>
        <button class="submit-btn">提交作业</button>
    </div>
    <div class="card">
        <h2>作业讲解视频</h2>
        <div class="video-area">
            <p>视频讲解区域（可嵌入B站/本地视频）</p>
            <video width="80%" controls style="margin-top:10px;">
                <source src="#" type="video/mp4">
                您的浏览器不支持视频播放
            </video>
        </div>
    </div>
    <div class="card">
        <h2>已布置作业列表</h2>
        <div class="task-item">一年级数学：10以内加减法</div>
        <div class="task-item">二年级数学：乘法口诀练习</div>
        <div class="task-item">三年级数学：应用题专项训练</div>
    </div>
</div>
</body>
</html>
